# fires on an English keyword there plus the surrounding prose. There is no
# literal to allowlist by regex (a regex over sentence fragments would be both
# fragile and far too broad), and the line has since moved within the file, so
# it is reachable only at the commit that introduced it — which is exactly the
# case this file's header reserves for a fingerprint.
